1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,930
Not every feature needs AI. Four questions decide it.

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:12,530
Use AI only if a fixed rule can't do the job, occasional errors are acceptable, a wrong answer can be caught or undone, and you have real data to test it. Fail two? Ship the rule first.

3
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:17,730
An invoice total: use a rule. Summarising a messy complaint: AI. Approving refunds automatically: be careful.

4
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:22,730
Rule first. AI where it earns it. Save this for your next roadmap review.
